  "term": "Vistaril",
  "definition": "Vistaril is a brand name for hydroxyzine pamoate, a form of hydroxyzine. It is an antihistamine that can reduce allergy-related effects and also has sedating, anti-nausea, antispasmodic, and anti-anxiety effects, including actions on histamine receptors in the brain.",
